# 18. Create a Kubernetes Service

The Pods are running, but we need a way to access the application.

Create:

```text
service.yaml
```

Add:

```yaml
apiVersion: v1
kind: Service

metadata:
  name: kubernetes-web-service

spec:
  type: NodePort

  selector:
    app: kubernetes-web

  ports:
    - protocol: TCP
      port: 80
      targetPort: 80
      nodePort: 30080
```

---

# 19. Understand the Service

The Deployment creates Pods.

The Service provides network access to those Pods.

```text
Browser
   │
   ▼
Service
   │
   ├──── Pod 1
   │
   └──── Pod 2
```

The important section is:

```yaml
selector:
  app: kubernetes-web
```

It finds Pods having:

```yaml
app: kubernetes-web
```

