# 22. Scale the Deployment

This is an important part of the practical.

Currently:

```text
replicas: 2
```

Check:

```bash
kubectl get pods
```

You should have 2 Pods.

Now scale to 4:

```bash
kubectl scale deployment kubernetes-web-deployment --replicas=4
```

Check:

```bash
kubectl get pods
```

You should now have:

```text
4 Pods
```

Check the Deployment:

```bash
kubectl get deployment
```

Expected:

```text
NAME                      READY
kubernetes-web-deployment 4/4
```

---

# 23. Scale Down

You can also reduce the number of Pods:

```bash
kubectl scale deployment kubernetes-web-deployment --replicas=2
```

Check:

```bash
